webview features
    1. check for prerequisite on install or run
    2. scan phone lib {
        check connectivity status();
        pull phone lib to db
    }
    3. request sync

adb features
    1. function to check connectivity status
    2. get devices
    3. get device info
    4. function to pull phone library to db
    5. push tracks
    6. delete track
    7. trigger media scan

sync features
    1. compare libraries
    2. create sync plan
    3. sync
    4. push new songs
    5. delete pending songs
    6. update statuses 

songs features
    1. get filesize
    2. update filesize
    3. file exists
    4. delete file
    5. open musicBrains picard
    6. get metadata

configure features
    1. get settings
    2. get phone destination
    3. set phone destination
    4. get pc music destination
    5. set pc music destination
    6. validate settings

library features
